# Strategy fixtures and their calibration hashes are byte-level contracts.
# Keep checkout bytes stable on every CI runner and developer platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Every PR adds its entry at the top of the work log, so two open PRs always
# touch the same spot. Union keeps both entries instead of a conflict (a
# conflicted PR gets no CI run at all). Entries start with a "### " heading so
# they stay apart even when union drops the blank line between them.
docs/WORKLOG.md merge=union
